  - `search_query_event`: Privacy-safe structured telemetry (no raw user text; only parsed structured fields: normalised location candidate, resolved locality/city, resolution method, fuzzy confidence, BHK key, property type key, furnishing key, suggestion count, selection outcome, session hash)
  - `search_alias_candidate`: Aggregated candidate evidence table with full status lifecycle (CANDIDATE → APPROVED / REJECTED / AUTO_PROMOTED / DISABLED)
