**Backend — Test:**
- `test/.../service/SearchLearningServiceTest.java`: 21 JUnit 5 unit tests covering: telemetry capture, session deduplication, exception swallowing, hash determinism, alias cache resolution (city-scoped, agnostic fallback, blank input guards), candidate aggregation (creation, update, ambiguity skip), promotion (clean candidate → ACTIVE alias, ambiguity guard, existing-alias skip, exception swallowing), threshold contract assertions (MIN_EVIDENCE_FOR_PROMOTION ≥ 10, MIN_SELECTION_RATE ≥ 0.70)

