### Safety Guarantees Implemented
1. Telemetry capture is `@Async` and wraps all logic in try/catch; never blocks autocomplete
2. Per-session deduplication: max 3 events per (session_hash, location_candidate) per 1-hour window
3. Raw user text is never stored; only normalised structured parser output
4. No personal identifiers stored; session_hash is one-way SHA-256
