8. Aliases can be disabled at any time; disable audit preserved in disabled_at / disabled_reason
9. Canonical business data (localities, cities, listings) is NEVER mutated by the learning system
10. `@Autowired(required=false)` ensures SearchLearningService is null-safe in all existing tests

