   - Arrow click handlers lacked `e.stopPropagation()`, `e.preventDefault()`, and did not automatically pause active video playback when changing media.
3. **Back to Discovery Contrast**:
   - A single light surface (`bg-white/92`) with thin border cannot guarantee WCAG AAA contrast across high-key white backgrounds, pitch-dark videos, and saturated colorful photographs simultaneously.

